Node ID=22 Titans aren't named at birth
Text=Yes, I understand that your kind is named at birth. It is, I think, a bizarre way of going about it. With my people, an individual is identified by his function or a defining characteristic until he has earned the right to choose a permanent name, usually in honor of one of the great forefathers.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Custom Requirement=COR
{
Operand1=CUseCannedExpressionExpression
{
Canned Expression=Dialog/Requirements/Races/Tainted race - feralkin or sylvant
}
Operator=
Operand2=CUseCannedExpressionExpression
{
Canned Expression=Dialog/Requirements/Races/Demokin IS
}
}
Reply Text=My kind was named twice. The second time the Church did the naming, and it was not meant kindly.
Go to node ID=23 named twice
Icon=Attribute Icon

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Who are the "great forefathers"?
