Node ID=23 named twice
Text=Ah. Tainted, imbued, feralkin, demokin -- I have heard the words your priests use, and they are names for a function, exactly as mine is. The difference is that yours was chosen for you by creatures who are afraid of you, which is no basis for a name at all. Earn another one, manling. That is the only advice a guard can give you.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Who are the "great forefathers"?
Go to node ID=24 A titan must earn his name

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Why have you sacked this town?
Go to node ID=30 Why have you sacked this town

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I will think about it.
Go to node ID=90 Farewell
Icon=Exit Icon
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=24 A titan must earn his name
Text=The fathers of our race are not unknown to human mythology. Names like Atlas and Gaia are revered, as they should be. When I name myself, I will choose the name of one of these great forebears and, by living a moral life, bring honor to my namesake.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Custom Requirement=CHasPerkExpression
{
Perks To Check For=Array
{
Item Count=1
Perk To Check For=Perks/!Event Title Perks/Child Killer
}
}
Reply Text=I have earned a name among my own kind already. They call me a killer of children.
Go to node ID=25 the name you have earned
Icon=Attribute Icon

Requirement=!None
Custom Requirement=CHasPerkExpression
{
