Node ID=25 the name you have earned
Text=<Tereo takes a long step back from you.> Then you have understood the custom better than most of your kind and used it worse than any of us. No titan would carry that; we would set it down in the mountains and leave the one who earned it standing beside it. Do not tell me your birth-name. I will remember you by the one you have just given me.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Why have you sacked this town?
Go to node ID=30 Why have you sacked this town

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=You keep a cage full of children yourself.
Go to node ID=40 Titans don't eat people

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Remember it well.
