Node ID=25 a name that was earned
Text=Champion. A name given for a deed, by the ones the deed was done for, and carried by a creature that had no say in it. That is how it should be done, manling, and I would not have expected it of goblins. When I take my own name I hope somebody has as much right to give it to me.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Why have you sacked this town?
Go to node ID=30 Why have you sacked this town

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=What will you choose?
Go to node ID=24 A titan must earn his name

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Good luck with it.
Go to node ID=90 Farewell
Icon=Exit Icon
Is Default Reply=1
