Node ID=30 Why have you sacked this town
Text=We did not come here by choice, nor do we make a habit of interfering in the lives of lesser races. But it is not my place to speak to you of such things. It is my place only to ascertain your motives and ask you to speak to the elder Lethos, who can be found further up this path.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
