Node ID=40 Titans don't eat people
Text=I don't know where you got that notion, but it is obviously false. We are made of *stone*, manling, why would we need or even want to eat flesh? The very thought of it sickens me.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Why should I believe you?
Go to node ID=42 Human stereotypes

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=And what of the ogre standing behind you, is he made of stone, too?
Go to node ID=41 Ogres

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I have other questions, then.
Go to node ID=06 Other questions
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=41 Ogres
Text=Ah, yes, well perhaps our servants ate one, possibly two humans when we first arrived here, but they have had a steady diet of mutton since then. Strictly mutton.  
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Custom Requirement=CUseCannedExpressionExpression
{
Canned Expression=Dialog/Requirements/Derived Attributes/Outwit 7 greater or equal
}
Reply Text=One human, or two? You are set to guard a pen and you cannot count your own dead.
Go to node ID=43 counting
Icon=Attribute Icon

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Why should I believe you?
Go to node ID=42 Human stereotypes

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I have other questions, then.
Go to node ID=06 Other questions
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=43 counting
Text=...Two. Perhaps three. The ogres are not watched as closely as I would watch them, and they are not made of stone, and they are hungry in a way we are not. I have said as much to Iapetus. He has a great deal on his mind and an ogre's appetite is low on the list. You may draw your own conclusions about how careful we have been here.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Why should I believe anything you say?
Go to node ID=42 Human stereotypes

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I have other questions.
Go to node ID=06 Other Questions

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=That is all I needed.
Go to node ID=90 Farewell
Icon=Exit Icon
Is Default Reply=1
