Node ID=42 Human stereotypes
Text=How your understanding of our race has changed over the years! There was a time when we were properly revered as your superiors. Now we are perceived as frightful beasts who exist only to waylay and harass your pitiful species. Nothing could be farther from the truth.  
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=What do you consider the truth?
Go to node ID=44 The truth

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I have other questions, then.
Go to node ID=06 Other questions
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=44 The truth
Text=*My* truth is that I was given only the task of determining your motives in coming here. Much can be explained to you by Lethos and the other elders. If you wish to speak with him, you will find him further up this path.  
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Very well, I will speak with Lethos.
