Node ID=50 Knights Templar
Text=You must mean the warriors who attempted to defend this town. They refused to surrender and left us no choice but to squash them. It was regrettable, and I hope that you will not make the same mistake.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I have a more temperate disposition. I will at least speak with you before passing judgement.
