Node ID=51 the Inquisition
Text=Then you are the one they send to decide what a thing is before they kill it. That is very nearly my own office today, manling, so we will understand one another. I was set here to learn your motives, and you have told me yours in one breath. Whether the elders answer to your Church is not mine to say.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Why have you sacked this town?
